## Update Checklist

Before publishing any Moonwell update:

1. **Fetch from DefiLlama API:**
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/protocol/moonwell` (TVL by chain, borrowed)
   - [ ] `api.llama.fi/summary/fees/moonwell` (fees, revenue)

2. **Fetch from CoinGecko API:**
   - [ ] `api.coingecko.com/api/v3/coins/moonwell-artemis` (WELL token)
   - Extract: Price, market cap, supply, volume, ATH/ATL

3. **Update report metrics:**
   - [ ] TVL total and by chain
   - [ ] WELL token price and market cap
   - [ ] Fee generation metrics
   - [ ] Any new security incidents

4. **Citation check:**
   - [ ] Every footnote `[^N]:` has at least one `[^N]` reference in body
   - [ ] All sources have human-readable URLs

